  "title": "How to Work with Fractions",
  "content": "<p><strong>Adding/Subtracting:</strong> Find a common denominator, convert, then add/subtract numerators.</p><p><strong>Multiplying:</strong> Multiply numerators together and denominators together. Simplify.</p><p><strong>Dividing:</strong> Flip the second fraction (reciprocal) and multiply. KFC — Keep, Flip, Change.</p><p>For <strong>mixed numbers</strong>, convert to improper fractions first.</p>",
